$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM N-{1,1-Bis(acetoxymethyl)-3-[2-chloro-4-(3-hydoxyphenylthio)phenyl]propyl}acetamide
(7) A mixture of 5 (10.0 g, 23.0 mmol), 3-hydroxythiophenol (2.8 mL, 27.6
mmol), tris(dibenzylideneacetone)dipalladium(0) chloroform adduct (600
mg, 0.58 mmol), 4,5-bis(diphenylphosphino)-9,9-dimethylxanthene (665 mg,
1.2 mmol) and N,N-diisopropylethylamine (8.0 mL, 46.0 mmol) in
1,4-dioxane (46 mL) was stirred at 120 °C for 9 h. After pouring into aq
1 M HCl (100 mL), the mixture was extracted with EtOAc (3 × 200 mL). The
combined organic layers were washed with brine (2 × 100 mL), dried
(Na2SO4), and concentrated in vacuo. The residue was purified by silica
gel column chromatography (hexane-EtOAc) to give 7. White solid, yield
9.48 g, 86% mp 142-143 °C. IR (ATR): 3468, 3271, 3072, 1740, 1714, 1641
cm-1. 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ = 1.84 (s, 3 H), 1.92-1.97 (m, 2 H),
2.02 (s, 6 H), 2.62-2.66 (m, 2 H), 4.20 (d, J = 11.0 Hz, 2 H), 4.29 (d, J
= 11.0 Hz, 2 H), 6.71-6.78 (m, 3 H), 7.18-7.33 (m, 4 H), 7.69 (s, 1 H),
9.70 (br s, 1 H). MS (ESI): m/z = 480 [M + H]. Anal. Calcd for
C23H26ClNO6S: C, 57.55; H, 5.46; N, 2.92. Found: C, 57.46; H, 5.44; N,
2.86.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Efficient synthesis of the immunomodulating compound KRP-203
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Hamada, Maiko; Kiuchi, Masatoshi; Adachi, Kunitomo
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthesis (2007), (13), 1927-1929

