Hz, 2 H), 2.35 (s, 3 H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 137.83, 137.45,
137.39, 132.46, 130.35, 129.81, 129.53, 90.55, 20.76. HRMS (EI): m/z [M]+
calcd for C13H11IS: 325.9626; found: 325.9640.
