$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM To a mixture of 1-Bromo-2-(p-tolylethynyl)benzene (1.36 g, 5 mmol),
Pd2(dba)3 (115 mg, 0.125 mmol, 2.5 mol%), Xantphos (14.5 mg, 0.25 mmol, 5
mol%) and 1 M LiHMDS in toluene (6.0 ml, 6 mmol, 1.2 eq.) was added
triisopropylsilanethiol(1.3 ml, 6 mmol, 1.2 eq.). The resulting mixture
was stirred at 120 °C for 8 h. After cooling, the mixture was quickly
filtered through a short pad of neutral alumina gel with ether as eluent.
After evaporation, GPC of the residue, which was unstable on silica gel,
afforded compound 1f as a pale yellow solid (1.62 g, 85 %). 1H NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3) δ 1.09 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 18H), 1.32 (sept, J = 7.2 Hz, 3H),
2.37 (s, 3H), 7.12 - 7.20 (m, 4H), 7.46 (m, 2H), 7.52 (ddd, J = 9.6, 7.2,
2.0 Hz, 2H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 13.33, 18.39, 21.52, 88.76,
94.09, 120.44, 126.42, 127.62, 128.87, 129.15, 131.32, 132.83, 134.18,
135.83, 138.08. IR (neat) 2944, 2866, 2217, 1509, 1460 cm-1. HRMS (ESI)
calcd. for (M+Na)+ 403.1886, found. 403.1887.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Gold-Catalyzed Cyclization of (ortho-Alkynylphenylthio)silanes:
